 <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Microsoft Entra hybrid join requires AD DS DNS resolution and domain-controller line of sight for provisioning and sign-in.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The customer VNet region determines Cloud PC placement. Keep AVD and Windows 365 service endpoints reachable over supported outbound paths.&lt;br&gt;No direct inbound Internet connection is used for normal Cloud PC access; user connectivity is provided through Azure Virtual Desktop reverse connect.&lt;br&gt;Microsoft Entra Domain Services isn't supported for the Microsoft Entra hybrid join model." style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;fontColor=#172B4D;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="1020" width="1300" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
